  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845783,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 0-to-X: A Puzzle of Progression for the NES\n\nPrepare to be captivated by *0-to-X*, a fiendishly addictive tile-matching puzzler for the Nintendo Entertainment System! Inspired by a popular internet sensation, this game challenges your spatial reasoning and reflexes as you manipulate numbered tiles to reach the ultimate goal: transforming '0' into 'X'.\n\nDeveloped by nemesys and featuring a mesmerizing soundtrack by Memblers – showcasing previously unheard music spanning two decades – *0-to-X* offers a unique and nostalgic audio experience. Gameplay is deceptively simple: slide tiles across the grid, strategically combining them to increase their values. But beware! Careful planning and quick thinking are essential to avoid gridlock and achieve victory.\n\n*0-to-X* isn't just about matching tiles; it's about mastering a system. High scores are permanently saved thanks to the innovative GTROM technology, allowing you to track your progress and compete for leaderboard dominance. Can you conquer the challenge and transform 0 into X?"
    },
